A '''Linebacker''' (Japanese: '''フットボーラー''' ''Footballer'') is a type of {{pkmn|Trainer}} class introduced in [[Generation V]]. They are players of {{wp|gridiron football}}. All Linebackers are found in the [[Big Stadium and Small Court|Big Stadium]]. They mostly specialize in {{type|Fighting}} Pokémon and Pokémon with high [[Stat|Defense]]s.

