===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|BW}}====
In ''[[BW051|Lost at the Stamp Rally!]]'', {{Ash}} and {{an|Iris}} went to the Big Stadium to watch a football game between the teams "{{p|Gurdurr}} 11" and "Team {{p|Darmanitan}}". Although no Linebackers were seen live, two were shown on a poster telling about the big game.

According to Iris, she is a huge fan of "Gurdurr 11" because they have been training in the [[Village of Dragons]] for a long time.
{{-}}

==Trivia==
* In a real game of {{wp|American football}}, a Linebacker would never use a 3-point stance and no player would use a closed fist. Using a closed fist during a game could potentially disqualify them from participating.

